{"parse": {"title": "AFF-18", "pageid": 123513, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-17\" title=\"AFF-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-18</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-19\" title=\"AFF-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">18</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雨\">雨</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雨</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Rain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>其<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>罩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>机<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>偿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>愿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210118</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无半点犹豫，阿黛拉快步奔向西莉亚，试图扶稳好友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>后者虚弱地摇了摇头，制止她徒劳的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-641414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-641414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-641414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师的视线越过了众人，投向逐渐昏沉的天幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>没有用。这只是必然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……您在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>这究竟是怎么回事？您打算告诉我，眼前的这一切……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她也笑了。然后将视线投向塔下的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>游行中的野兽穿上奇装异服，再次伪装起人类，罢工游行化为了狂欢节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又接连有人从巷子和建筑中走出，披上野兽与人的外衣，加入这场狂猎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>整座城市乱七八糟，巴士底柱变成比尔博凯特玩具，维尔特-加朗广场的石雕被换成一只滑稽的龙虾……而我的朋友正在消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您要说这些都是注定的命运？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>如此可笑……如此荒谬，毫无意义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>某个词语触动了贝丽尔，她从恍惚中回过神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>啊……对。是这样。我要感谢你，阿黛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我得到了答案。所谓的命运现在只是一团荒谬的、混乱的、发了疯的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这场“暴雨”本不该到来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>“暴雨”……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她茫然地重复，望向四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚弱到吐不出哪怕一个字的西莉亚，昏迷的费利西安，静静注视着她们的贝丽尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人皆已疲惫不堪，舞台上仅剩下一位狂喜的演员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>这场雨……不在我们的预测里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>“癔症”在发生变化……它们变得更一致了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>有什么在“统一”并“修正”它们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他踉跄了一步，在笔记本上写下最后一笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>原来如此！原来如此！就像一个自由演出的剧场，现在已经发展到不得不更换幕布的时候——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>而本不存在的剧变加快了时代的动荡！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>只要用同样的方式，只需要稍加推动，只是点一把火而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>“暴雨”可以被我们操纵——它可以被提前引发！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>而这些癔症，是的，物质世界不过是精神的臆想，所有的变化都来源于演员们的集体潜意识……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>哈哈哈……哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>所有的话语不过是对旧作的引用，对生命的爱也不过是演员的职业道德！这出连编剧都没有的戏剧，所演出的不过是众人的自我幻想！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>这才是世界的真相——连至高规律都要掩饰这一点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>却是我发现了……哈哈哈！却是我发现了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>迷思海会被修正，一如世界所有的错误……可谁说错误不是正确？正确只是一个连绵不绝的错误……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>劳伦·罗西几乎要把后仰的腰给折断。空中的建筑折射着他眼中欣喜若狂的光彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔看向他，神情中多少掺杂有一点儿怜悯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>他怎么回事……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>罗西先生只是正被他毕生追求的事物吸引。或者，你可以认为他疯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但很快，清醒还是疯癫，这些都不再重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我们所熟悉的巴黎，以及这个无序的浪漫时代，都将被冲刷殆尽。毁灭它的雨即将到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>这太荒谬了！您竟然开这种玩笑！这根本……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不可能……一场雨会带走一个时代……这种毫无道理的解释……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-641413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-641413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-641413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西莉亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-313516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-313516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-313516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不，西莉亚……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_47.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_47\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_47\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_2_at_47.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_47.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_2_at_47.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_47.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_2_at_47.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_47.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巴黎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光之城，浪漫之城，充满象征与寓言的城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它不吝于展示其中混乱的激情、不同立场之间的倾轧、<br />在古老拥挤的巷子里上演的阴谋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为它捍卫选择的权利。<br />呼喊或沉默，怀旧的与现代的，君主制、共和制、令人眼花缭乱的主义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你尽可以投身其中，或一无所信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那些学说、那些复杂的历史……她都记得很清楚，她比我更喜欢这片地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她那么认真……是最应该活下来的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-313524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>为什么是西莉亚……？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_72.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_72\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_72\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-3_2_at_72.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_72.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-3_2_at_72.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_72.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-3_2_at_72.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_72.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一座小径交叉的花园，它包容无数选择，允许每条岔路存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些思想流经每个人，变得具体可感。<br />《艾那尼》，圣母院，飘浮在圣皮埃尔宫上空的热气球……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是巴黎的灵魂，对命运和生活报以优雅而戏谑的审视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它承载了过多的想象与幻梦，是一席流动的盛宴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绝不腐朽，无法焚毁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>我还需在这毫无意义的劣等世界里寻找什么呢？真正的世界已经降临！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>那沉在宝库底部的湖水……令一切趋于完美……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗西教授：</div><div>它就在……意识深处……在所有人的脑袋里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>永恒真实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>永在你的脑海之中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>迷思海的裂隙要关上了。“暴雨”正在修正谬误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>自天而降的光之城、不属于人世的幽灵、徘徊的野兽都会消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>疯人得偿所愿，剧目已至尾声，而失控的一切重归秩序的统治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640930.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640930.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640930.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640930.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-640930.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640930.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手死死抓住了贝丽尔的脚踝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>噢，你醒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>也许你就这样睡着更好。能够躲开精神的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我什么时候……躲躲藏藏……过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她艰难地抽气，尽管空气与风都已无法从她消散的身体中灌进胸腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>贝丽尔，你必须——解决这些，快想办法！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>告诉我要怎么做？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我绝对不会为这种莫名其妙的——理由——消失！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔轻松地抬起脚，迈开步子。费利西安的手指猛然攥紧了一团空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>应该去死的不是我，是那群蠢货！那群只知道舔统治者脚趾的庸人，甚至用不了神秘术的废物——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>这个世界本该属于我们——活下来的本该是我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>贝丽尔·布翁尼！滚回来、别走——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我会向引导之人上报所有事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远去的脚步声顿了顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你让劳伦·罗西去送死，我看到了……你别想装傻——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你根本没有对任何人忠诚过，你是个见鬼的商人……贝丽尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>除了自己的利益，你什么都不在乎……你从来没有真正认可过重塑之手的理念，也不想将世界带回那美好的时代——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的脚步停在了她面前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_08\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_2_at_08.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"270\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_2_at_08.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_2_at_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2400\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-313412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-313412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-313412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你真有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-313420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-313420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-313420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你有求于我，却选择威胁我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-313418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-313418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-313418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>如果对方想让你就此永远闭嘴呢？你怎么办，费利西安小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她俯视着费利西安，像打量一只狼狈挣扎的珍稀动物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>那么，就是这样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>能认识你，我十分荣幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在贝丽尔起身前，费利西安终于颤抖着挤出微不可闻的句子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_75_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_75_zone\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_75_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/48/Cg-3_2_at_75_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"374\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"372\" data-file-height=\"232\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640921.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-640921.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640921.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640921.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-640921.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640921.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-640921.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640921.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>咕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低下头，喉头艰难地移动着。水珠从她的发梢上滴落，一直落到尘埃里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>求……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>求你……贝丽尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我不想……我不想死……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313422.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313422.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔点了点头，站直身子，提出了最后的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这次，她望向的是怔在原地的阿黛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你怎么想，阿黛拉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你是否希望她以死偿还自己的过错？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-18"}}